# Dependencies
# Third-party packages and external libraries managed by package managers.
# Rebuilt locally by running 'npm install'.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build & Distribution Artifacts
# Compiled bundles, packaged Electron/desktop binaries, installers, and build outputs.
# Excluded to avoid bloating the Git repository with generated binary assets.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
dist/
releases/
build/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Internal Data, Test Sandboxes & Scratch Assets
# - .cute-agents-desk/: Default local runtime directory when running the app or
#   tests locally. Contains test databases, sandbox agent worktrees (wt/),
#   toy-repo fixture, task outboxes, and events.jsonl.
# - design-ref/: Local UI/UX design mockups, reference screenshots, and scratchpad
#   assets not meant for production distribution.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.cute-agents-desk/
design-ref/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Test & Execution Logs, Crash Dumps & Package Manager Traces
# - *.log: All execution logs, test output dumps (e.g. test scheduler logs created
#   during verify-scheduled-tasks.js, agent pty.log terminal outputs, and any
#   ad-hoc test trace generated in the repo).
# - npm-debug.log*, yarn-debug.log*, yarn-error.log*: Failure reports generated
#   when npm/yarn install or test commands fail locally.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment Variables, Secrets & Local Credentials
# Environment variables, machine-specific overrides, and sensitive local credentials
# (such as API keys, account tokens, or local settings in accounts.json / config.json).
# WARNING: Keep out of version control to prevent credential leakage.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env*.local
accounts.json
config.json

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Operating System Metadata
# System-generated indexing and folder layout metadata from macOS and Windows.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IDE & Code Editor Configurations
# Developer-specific workspace settings (VS Code, JetBrains IDEs) and temporary swap files.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
